{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "label": "Push-based query", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "intro", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When the journal exposes an in-process event bus, the live events* streams automatically subscribe and yield each event within milliseconds instead of waiting a poll interval. There is no opt-in flag - it happens whenever the journal has a bus - and the poll stays as a safety net, so a higher pollIntervalMs is fine."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_journaleventsbus", "label": "journal.events in-process bus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## Which journals push", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The in-memory and SQLite journals wire it up automatically; a custom Journal opts in by exposing an events bus and publishing on each successful append. It fires synchronously on the writer's append path, so bus subscribers must stay light."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_eventsbytag", "label": "eventsByTag live stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## Consuming a live stream", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_eventsbypersistenceid", "label": "eventsByPersistenceId live stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## Consuming a live stream", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_livequeryoptions", "label": "LiveQueryOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## Consuming a live stream", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tunes only the fallback poll; there is deliberately no `push` field because push is automatic when the bus exists."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_busdeliverstheevent", "label": "The bus delivers the event object, not a wake-up", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## The bus delivers the event, not just a wake-up", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The push stream subscribes first, does the catch-up read for history, then drains buffered bus events, so there is no start-up gap. Each publication carries the event object itself, so the stream never re-queries the journal per notification; at-least-once is preserved because the fallback poll picks up anything a subscription missed."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_inprocessonly", "label": "The bus is in-process only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## In-process only", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Push works only when the writer and the stream consumer share an ActorSystem. Across nodes you are bounded by polling, the journal's own replication/CDC, or a DistributedPubSub layer you publish on yourself."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_projectionactorpolls", "label": "ProjectionActor polls; it does not use the bus", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## ProjectionActor polls - it does not use the bus", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It drives itself by polling the one-shot currentEventsBy* queries on a timer, so a projection's latency is bounded by its poll interval. For true push latency, consume the live events* stream directly rather than going through ProjectionActor."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_journaleventsbus", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_eventsbytag", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_eventsbypersistenceid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_livequeryoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_busdeliverstheevent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_journaleventsbus", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_inprocessonly", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_projectionactorpolls", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_projectionactorpolls", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_projections_projectionactor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## ProjectionActor polls - it does not use the bus", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_projectionactorpolls", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_projections_pollinterval", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## ProjectionActor polls - it does not use the bus", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_persistent_actor_persistentactor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_journaleventsbus", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "intro sequence diagram", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_push_based_query_pushbasedquery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_projections_projection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/push-based-query.mdx", "source_location": "## Where to next", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}